Subject: [PATCH 11/17] [M158] [Views] Spot-protect button updates in dialogs.

Original change's description:
> [Views] Spot-protect button updates in dialogs.
>
> This prevents a case where badly-configured or malicious accessibility
> handlers modify a dialog in the middle of the dialog buttons being
> modified.
>
